'''Ty''' is a [[Ninja|ninja]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] that can be found in [[Lakeshore]]. He is a retired ninja trainer, he is also once the leader of the Flying Dragon Clan. He once taught in the defunct [[Flying Dragon Dojo]] but it got closed down for an unknown reason and Ty now stands outside his hut where he lives.

